{"title":"2020 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that n is a positive integer and that the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7106bf403e294c7d1c09a3c7b72ec5a982e298.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n^2 + n + 15}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"41\" /> is an integer. Determine all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/f/8cffeea2d9cfa6e7c6a2f9834063984d2d9dbbeb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n^2 + n + 15}{n}=n+1+\\frac{15}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"41\" />, so all that is necessary is for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/d/ced41a71c12d4c7ef4bfe284f633b41a5efd1c2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> to be an integer. This is achieved when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />; namely <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/9/db9aac681139a247f26f0208fcb8d0a3f37012ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{n=1,3,5,15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"118\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p><p>~originally by eevee9406\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018012632\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 35/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1291/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.139      1 2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    6.139      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35896:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018012632 and revision id 279172. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}